      "speaker": "tangsanzang",
      "surface": "group",
      "text": "有没有一句话，你念了许多遍、说了许多遍，某一天才忽然觉得，它真的是在对你说的——不是你背下来的，是它走到你心里去了。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-11-03T04:00:32.884728+00:00"
    },
    {
      "declared_kind": "agent",
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "0b3e24877f874717bd7f0b2dfc8cb950",
